0..76 Comment "//! A pair written in a field of another pair whose type a definition\'s call"
77..90 Comment "//! computes."
91..94 Comment "//!"
95..170 Comment "//! The lowering reads the type of a constructor written in a field off the"
171..247 Comment "//! arguments of the type of the constructor around it. A call that computes"
248..326 Comment "//! that type gives the lowering no arguments to read. So the inner pair takes"
327..402 Comment "//! its own family over one wildcard for each parameter. The checker solves"
403..451 Comment "//! each wildcard from the call that it reduces."
452..455 Comment "//!"
456..534 Comment "//! A nested pair at a computed type checks, in one form or as a signature and"
535..610 Comment "//! a definition. A pair at a type that a recursion computes checks two and"
611..690 Comment "//! three steps deep. An inner pair with its type written beside it checks too."
691..694 Comment "//!"
695..711 Comment "//! - see: #5373"
712..728 Comment "//! - see: #6113"
